&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p style="clear:both; line-height:0.75pt; width:100%; font-size:0.75pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;③　譲渡価額及び決済方法&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:11pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;ａ．譲渡価額　　約40百万円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text4" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:11pt;line-height:15pt;"&gt;ｂ．決済方法　　現金決済&lt;/p&gt;
